# ColorTreeStudio

## Summary

The interactive Munsell studio as a reusable glimmer component — the room the specimen is held in. `ColorTreeField`'s edit format renders this component; the studio itself owns no field state. The current selection flows in through `@color` / `@munsell`, and picks flow out (debounced 300ms) through `@onPick`. `@compact` bounds the room for form use (panel closed by default, reduced masthead); `@hasLinkedTheme` suppresses the built-in night-sky palette when a Theme card is linked.

It carries the full experience: tumble/slice/atlas interaction, the Munsell↔Itten morph, contextual hints, the control panel, and the ambient WebAudio layer.

## Import

```javascript
import { ColorTreeStudio } from '../components/color-tree-studio';
```

## Usage

```gts
<ColorTreeStudio
  @color={{this.hex}}
  @munsell={{this.notation}}
  @onPick={{this.onPick}}
  @compact={{true}}
/>
```
